  // Per character and per Dofus: «.eveil <dofus> commencer» sacrifices the copies (the fragment
  // and the quest begin), then every dungeon of the route must have its boss beaten -- in HARDCORE
  // when requireHardcore, and only wins AFTER the start count --, then «.eveil <dofus> defi» opens
  // the final challenge, alone, against the boss scaled to the Dofus level. Winning it gives the
  // stasified Dofus: the template's own lines plus «effects» plus «approximated», with a
  // «Fabricado por» line reading «label» (so it is never taken for an S1-S4 piece, nor sacrificed).
  //
  // Dungeons: datos/dungeons.json ids (Spanish client names in the comments), the spec's French
