  // sans nom in MonsterTemplates), so each is stood in for by the nearest existing boss of the
  // Dofus's own route, scaled to the Dofus level (Dreams.ScaleTo, as the Fissure's waves).
  //
  // Effects: item effect ids (124 sagesse, 125 vitalité, 118 force, 126 intelligence, 123 chance,
