  // 2803 % résistance mêlée, 2812 % dommages aux sorts, 753 tacle). The spec's conditional
  // effects (per turn, per stack, per adjacent enemy...) have no item effect the engine applies,
  // so «approximated» gives a flat line in their place; «replaces» says which effect it stands for.
